OL,3,AObama attacks Trump as he campaigns for
OL,4,ADemocrats ahead of midterm elections
OL,5,
OL,6,FFormer US President Barack Obama has
OL,7,Fattacked the Trump administration over
OL,8,Fthe Iran war and high consumer prices
OL,9,Fas he hit the campaign trail for
OL,10,FDemocrats ahead of the US midterm
OL,11,Felections.
OL,13,F"This election is our last best chance
OL,14,Fto at least rein in some of the
OL,15,Ffoolishness of this administration,"
OL,16,FObama told crowds in Ohio on Saturday.
OL,18,FMeanwhile, US President Donald Trump
OL,19,Ftouted his administration's immigration
OL,20,Fand tariff policies at a rally in
OL,21,FGeorgia, telling supporters "we're in
OL,22,Fthe golden age of America".
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
