OL,3,AObama attacks Trump as he campaigns for
OL,4,ADemocrats ahead of midterm elections
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe midterm elections on 3 November
OL,7,Fwill decide which party controls
OL,8,FCongress for the rest of Trump's term,
OL,9,Fand therefore how easy it is for the
OL,10,Fpresident to carry out his plans.
